/text&gt;&lt;!-- LEVEL 2 PODIUM: Senior Workflow Builder (x=335..585, y=488..762) --&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;335&quot; y=&quot;488&quot; width=&quot;250&quot; height=&quot;274&quot; rx=&quot;18&quot; fill=&quot;#EFF6FF&quot; stroke=&quot;#2563EB&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.4&quot;/&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;508&quot; width=&quot;118&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; rx=&quot;12&quot; fill=&quot;#2563EB&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;414&quot; y=&quot;524&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;10&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;LEVEL 2 • SENIOR L5&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;554&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;16&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;Harness Engineer&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;578&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;600&quot; fill=&quot;#1E3A8A&quot;&gt;• Constrained JSON CFG schemas&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;598&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;600&quot; fill=&quot;#1E3A8A&quot;&gt;• Byte-0 KV prefix cache (92% hit)&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;618&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;600&quot; fill=&quot;#1E3A8A&quot;&gt;• Lazy Top-4 MCP + OAuth OBO&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;638&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;600&quot; fill=&quot;#1E3A8A&quot;&gt;• Idempotent Saga checkpoints&lt;/text&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;355&quot; y=&quot;662&quot; width=&quot;210&quot; height=&quot;36&quot; rx=&quot;10&quot; fill=&quot;#DBEAFE&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;460&quot; y=&quot;684&quot; font-family=&quot;Courier New,monospace&quot; font-size=&quot;10.5&quot; font-weight=&quot;800&quot; fill=&quot;#1E40AF&quot; text-anch