uot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot; fill=&quot;#065F46&quot;&gt;• Flash ⇄ Argon confidence cascade&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;636&quot; y=&quot;532&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot; fill=&quot;#065F46&quot;&gt;• Orthogonal Multi-Model Judge&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;636&quot; y=&quot;552&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot; fill=&quot;#065F46&quot;&gt;• Versioned SKILL.md registry&lt;/text&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;636&quot; y=&quot;576&quot; width=&quot;210&quot; height=&quot;54&quot; rx=&quot;12&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;741&quot; y=&quot;598&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#6EE7B7&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;MULTIPLIES 15 TEAMS&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;741&quot; y=&quot;616&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;10&quot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot; fill=&quot;#E2E8F0&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;-93% $/turn • 0 SEV-1 Leaks&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;636&quot; y=&quot;744&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;12.5&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#047857&quot;&gt;96.4% pass^5 • Promo Packet&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="920" height="1150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

